    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk egg in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Tg3gxiEQkxmUOa6KiRC31h9Xz_s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260625-crumbled-chicken-tenderloin-air-fried-ddmfs-Step2-1394-33e180d649f54498bd811df863267205.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260625/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix bread crumbs and oil together in a second bowl until mixture becomes loose and crumbly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip each chicken tenderloin into the bowl of egg; shake off any residual egg. Dip chicken into crumb mixture, making sure it is evenly and fully covered.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jeZzrl_zFfz39wvfpY4W_W9tCbc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260625-crumbled-chicken-tenderloin-air-fried-ddmfs-Step3-1397-33d1db73f3b54ec2bed08864541b4a63.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260625/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay chicken tenderloins in the air fryer basket in an even layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Air-fry until no longer pink in the center, about 12 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
